IAU SOFA / ERFA algorithms and data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
packages/physics/src/frames/iau2006.ts and nut00b-data.ts implement algorithms and tabulated
coefficients published by the International Astronomical Union's Standards of Fundamental Astronomy
(SOFA) and redistributed as ERFA (https://github.com/liberfa/erfa), BSD-3-Clause:

  Copyright (C) 2013-2023, NumFOCUS Foundation.
  Derived from SOFA software, Copyright (C) 2013 IAU SOFA Board. All rights reserved.

Reference vectors in packages/physics/test/iau2006.test.ts are taken from the ERFA test suite
(t_erfa_c.c). This software is not part of the IAU SOFA Software Collection, and is not endorsed
by the IAU SOFA Board.

